# SEO Optimization

Every public page must be discoverable, indexable, and locally relevant.

## Metadata

- Export `metadata` or `generateMetadata` on every page
- Unique `title` and `description` per page — include service + location where relevant
- Set `openGraph` and `twitter` images (use `/public/og/` assets)
- Canonical URLs via `metadata.alternates.canonical`

```tsx
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: "Kitchen Remodel Contractor | Salt Lake City & Utah County",
  description: "Kitchen remodels with quality craftsmanship and clear, itemized estimates. Serving Salt Lake City and Utah County. Schedule a free consultation.",
  openGraph: { title: "...", description: "...", images: ["/og/kitchen.jpg"] },
};
```

## Content & Structure

- One `<h1>` per page; logical heading hierarchy (`h2` → `h3`)
- Descriptive alt text on every meaningful image
- Internal links between service pages, portfolio, and contact
- Target how homeowners search: "bathroom remodel Utah County", "basement finish Salt Lake City", "kitchen remodel contractor near me"
- Match contractor copy voice (see `contractor-copy` rule) — trust and process language, not corporate jargon

## Technical SEO

- Prefer static generation (`export const dynamic = 'force-static'`) for marketing pages
- Add `app/sitemap.ts` and `app/robots.ts`
- JSON-LD structured data for `LocalBusiness` and `Service` on relevant pages
- Clean URLs: `/services/kitchen-remodel`, not `/page?id=3`

## Local Business

- NAP consistency: True Ridge Construction, (801) 694-5910, Info@trueridgeconstruct.com
- Service area: Utah County and Salt Lake County
- Include contact info in footer on every page
